  "description": "Content pack scaffold: neurons-themed reskin of Taiwan Stage-1 medical board exam. Subjects to be renamed to neuron families on a Linnean phylogenetic taxonomy (4 neurotransmitter branches). Question corpus reuse + subject rename + statSchema override deferred to wire-neurons-content-and-theme.",
